sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Enrollment API
    participant DB as enrollment schema
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    Note over API,DB: drop + waitlist promotion are ONE transaction
    API->>DB: BEGIN · seat lock (offering)
    API->>DB: UPDATE course_enrollments SET status=DROPPED, deleted_at=now()
    API->>DB: INSERT registration_log COURSE_DROP
    alt the dropped row held a seat
        API->>DB: SELECT first WAITLISTED ORDER BY created_at
        API->>DB: UPDATE that row → ENROLLED
        API->>DB: INSERT registration_log WAITLIST_PROMOTED
    end
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-)MQ: enrollment.course-dropped
    API-)MQ: enrollment.waitlist-promoted
    Note over API,MQ: a crash before COMMIT leaves nothing half-done:<br/>no lost seat, no orphan promotion, no stray event
